{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/f080dce8aae7c88db56cda9c4c2299db.poster.avif?t=1773329651\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/f080dce8aae7c88db56cda9c4c2299db.webm?t=1773329651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dew is an atmospheric 2.5D platformer adventure set in a realistic micro-environment. As the mysterious</i><strong>\u00a0Necromold</strong> <i>is destroying and corrupting the living, two tiny heroes,</i> <strong>Myric </strong><i>and</i> <strong>Dewey</strong> <i>join forces to stop it and the source of evil behind it.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Single player or Co-op. Play with a less experienced player and let them &quot;ride with you&quot; through the more challenging parts.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Classic side-scrolling platformer with recognizable controls.\u00a0Dodge, dash, double jump, slide and hang glide your way through the dangerous paths.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unlock powerful new skills to traverse uncharted paths and confront even greater dangers.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0Explore a variety of beautiful levels, accompanied by an atmospheric score.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/4b2a912fcdbee67a0711986329173611.poster.avif?t=1773329651\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/4b2a912fcdbee67a0711986329173611.webm?t=1773329651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore a world inspired by the beauty of nature seen from a macro perspective, find secret</i> <strong>paths</strong> <i>and earn</i> <strong>rewards</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Symbiotic Skills</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Utilize the symbiotic skills of</i> <strong>Myric</strong> <i>and</i> <strong>Dewey</strong> <i>to traverse the world and overpower enemies.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Overpower and cure the cute, yet</i> <strong>creepy characters</strong> <i>infected by the dangerous</i> <strong>Necromold.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Grow strong</i>\u00a0enough to eventually take on the bigger bosses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/a91b7d7c3fb987447f4cd57108dd5174.poster.avif?t=1773329651\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/a91b7d7c3fb987447f4cd57108dd5174.webm?t=1773329651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br> <br>Maintaining the Balance</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Earn perks by solving</i> <strong>puzzles</strong> <i>to restore the environment or help characters in need.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Collect magic</i><strong>\u00a0dew drops</strong> <i>and send them through the</i> <strong>mycelium network</strong> <i>that maintains the balance in the world.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/a986cfef939a5f8daec20bd7ef2aaf40.poster.avif?t=1773329651\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/a986cfef939a5f8daec20bd7ef2aaf40.webm?t=1773329651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654640?t=1773329651","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/3f2134ac19df0f0bf2e2f0b62465aaad975fd76f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773329651","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/fc8e0c47f8754ab8f37489f75aa3c46df4c60c41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773329651","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/fc8e0c47f8754ab8f37489f75aa3c46df4c60c41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773329651","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/f080dce8aae7c88db56cda9c4c2299db.poster.avif?t=1773329651\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/f080dce8aae7c88db56c